# LevelUpWorld — tenancy

- Assume tenant isolation until evidence proves a shared resource is intentional.
- Never run cross-tenant queries, joins, or exports without an explicit, approved scope.
- Connector entitlements must be least-privilege and tenant-bound.
- Incident blast-radius estimates must separate confirmed vs hypothesized tenant impact.
- Fail closed when tenant context is missing on a mutate tool.
